@baseUrl = http://localhost:8085/renting
### Search movies by title or genre
GET {{baseUrl}}/peliculas?titulo=Clueless&genero=Drama //estos son los parametros que llegan del front end
Accept: application/json
Content-Type: application/json

#Create a movie
POST {{baseUrl}}/peliculas
Accept: application/json
Content-Type: application/json

